{"id":"660107","name":"南非彩啤梨凉粉","author":"鱼菲","authorId":"2270985","desc":"","cover":"images/660107/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南非彩啤梨","amount":"1个"},{"name":"白凉粉","amount":"15g"},{"name":"清水","amount":"750g"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"15g"}],"sub":[{"name":"南非小富士","amount":"1个"},{"name":"白茶","amount":"2包"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"制作南非彩啤梨凉粉：彩啤梨去皮切丁。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215684182186262270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入锅中，加入清水和白糖，大火煮开后放入白凉粉，搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215684658279702270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"再次煮沸后离火，倒入模具中等待凝固。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215684853946562270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"彩啤梨切薄片，放入盐水中浸泡备用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215685620697112270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"梨冻凝固后脱模切块，装入成品杯中，将盐水中的梨片捞出沥干水分，串起后放在顶部装饰即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215687884803592270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"制作苹果茶饮：苹果切片，放入容器中。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215686007264032270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入茶包，倒入1500ml的清水，密封冷藏6小时以上。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215686758073002270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"取出冷泡好的苹果茶。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215687295573432270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"先将苹果片装入成品杯中，再加入适量冰块。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215688355112892270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后倒入茶汤，放上半个苹果和胡椒叶装饰即可放上半个苹果和胡椒叶装饰即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/21/2024072117215688607596972270985.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"喜欢甜口的可以在苹果茶饮中加入适量蜂蜜。 \n\t\t\t\t\